From 58e163825be4033e2e81753dd352c0d1c089c99a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: scada <scada@noreply.codeberg.org>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 18:14:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 29/80] arm64: configs: joan_defconfig: Android core options
 from GKI

userfaultfd/anon VMA names (ART's CMC GC; without them zygote rejects the
boot image and crash-loops), legacy iptables tables, policy routing and the
socket diag/destroy bits netd needs, zram lz4 backend, fuse-bpf, f2fs
compression, quota, fscrypt/IPsec crypto, and the networking/memory
options gki_defconfig enables.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0144VMKxYe33NKa3LLPZNivr
